What is the output of the following program tracking instance identities?
```java
class Counter {
    int val;
    Counter(int val) {
        this.val = val;
    }
}
public class IdentityDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Counter c1 = new Counter(10);
        Counter c2 = new Counter(10);
        System.out.println((c1.val == c2.val) + " " + (c1 == c2));
    }
}
```

