What is the output of the following reassignment scenario?
```java
class DataTag {
    String label;
    DataTag(String label) {
        this.label = label;
    }
}
public class ReassignDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        DataTag t1 = new DataTag("A");
        DataTag t2 = t1;
        t1 = new DataTag("B");
        System.out.println(t1.label + ":" + t2.label);
    }
}
```
